<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>To My Wifey 💞</title>
<style>
    body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: 'Helvetica', sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe4e1, #ffb6c1);
        overflow: hidden;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        flex-direction: column;
        height: 100vh;
        color: #fff;
        text-align: center;
    }
    h1 {
        font-size: 2em;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: #ff6f91;
        text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff6f91;
    }
    p {
        font-size: 1.2em;
        max-width: 320px;
        margin: 0 auto 20px;
        color: #fff;
        line-height: 1.5;
        text-shadow: 0 0 5px #ff6f91;
    }
    #heartBtn {
        background: #ff6f91;
        border: none;
        padding: 15px 25px;
        border-radius: 25px;
        font-size: 1.2em;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: 0.3s;
        color: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff6f91;
    }
    #heartBtn:hover {
        transform: scale(1.1);
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px #ff6f91;
    }
    .heart {
        position: absolute;
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        background: red;
        transform: rotate(45deg);
        animation: floatUp linear infinite;
        opacity: 0.8;
    }
    .heart:after,
    .heart:before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        background: red;
        border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .heart:before {
        top: -10px;
        left: 0;
    }
    .heart:after {
        left: 10px;
        top: 0;
    }
    @keyframes floatUp {
        0% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(45deg); opacity: 1; }
        100% { transform: translateY(-700px) rotate(45deg); opacity: 0; }
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>To My Wifey 💞</h1>
<p>
My wifey, I know some days feel exhausting, like your heart’s carrying too much.<br>
But even when the world feels blurry, you are still my reason to smile.<br>
You’re my peace, my calm, and my favorite person to love.<br>
Take a deep breath, baby — I’m right here, even through the screen.<br>
You’re strong, beautiful, and loved more than words can ever say.<br><br>
— Your Husband 💖
</p>

<button id="heartBtn">Tap for my heart ❤️</button>

<audio id="bgMusic" loop autoplay>
    <source src="https://www.soundhelix.com/examples/mp3/SoundHelix-Song-1.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
</audio>

<script>
    const btn = document.getElementById('heartBtn');
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        alert("💖 I love you forever, my Wifey 💖");
    });

    function createHeart() {
        const heart = document.createElement('div');
        heart.className = 'heart';
        heart.style.left = Math.random() * window.innerWidth + 'px';
        heart.style.animationDuration = (4 + Math.random() * 4) + 's';
        heart.style.width = heart.style.height = (10 + Math.random() * 30) + 'px';
        document.body.appendChild(heart);
        setTimeout(() => { heart.remove(); }, 7000);
    }

    setInterval(createHeart, 250);

    // Fade in music
    const music = document.getElementById('bgMusic');
    music.volume = 0;
    let vol = 0;
    const fadeIn = setInterval(() => {
        if(vol < 0.2){
            vol += 0.01;
            music.volume = vol;
        } else {
            clearInterval(fadeIn);
        }
    }, 200);
</script>

</body>
</html>
